   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bold colour: high saturation (0.49), darker median (~87), deep shadows (32,19,20), cyan and magenta accents, warm-natural skin (168,132,104 / hue 26), punchy editorial contrast. Best for: Colourful outfits and decor, sangeet and mehendi with bold palettes, graphic fashion-style poses, strong-colour backdrops. Avoid on frames where colour is already clipping.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
